---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<footer class="footer-light relative overflow-hidden bg-white" role="contentinfo">

  <svg class="footer-brand-shape absolute" viewBox="70 -5 135 163" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="footerBrandGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#00132b" />
        <stop offset=".2" stop-color="#722CCE" />
        <stop offset=".4" stop-color="#81c1d6" />
        <stop offset=".6" stop-color="#7abf72" />
        <stop offset=".8" stop-color="#efc747" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#d58b3b" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path
      d="M116.33,46.53c-15.94,10.24-28.73,29.56-29.34,48.05-.32,8.32,2.23,19.12,11.82,20.57,9.57,1.09,17.09-8.34,21-16.14,5.52-12.43,6.96-27.35,15.26-38.85,8.48-11.85,19.69-23.74,35.5-23.79,19.15-.37,28.32,17.42,26.12,34.62-1.59,15.05-7.81,28.61-15.51,41.33-8.17,13.26-18.06,24.33-30.43,34.33-5.02,4.61-12.96,4.14-17.25-1.19-5.71-6.67-1.55-17.67,7.03-19.04,9.13-1.66,17.71-7.05,24.54-13.48,11.65-11.11,19.66-27.12,20.81-42.84.41-6.21-.3-12.36-2.84-16.98-5.51-10.07-21.53-12.47-31.06-5.51-5.51,3.95-10.47,8.72-14.15,14.39-8.03,11.65-8.5,25.88-14.26,38.78-4.81,9.79-13.07,20.8-25.29,20.48-13.59-.74-19.74-14.23-20.37-26.26-1.56-15.14,3.85-30.25,10.98-43.26,3.49-6.6,7.21-12.99,10.28-20.07,2.62-6.03,9.64-8.79,15.67-6.16,8.74,3.59,9.57,16.3,1.51,21.04h0Z"
      fill="url(#footerBrandGrad)"
    />
  </svg>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-8 relative z-10">

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-8">

      <!-- LEFT CARD -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative z-10">
        
        <div class="relative h-full w-full z-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-start p-8 lg:p-10">
          
          <!-- Solid Background (Left) -->
          <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 right-[20%] bg-[var(--color-brand-purple)] rounded-l-2xl z-[-1]"></div>
          
          <!-- Slanted Background (Right) with rounded corners -->
          <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-[60%] bg-[var(--color-brand-purple)] rounded-2xl z-[-2] origin-top-right" style="transform: skewX(-6deg);"></div>
          <a href="/" class="inline-block mb-6 relative z-10" aria-label="Inicio">
            <img src="/assets/logos/logo1.png" alt="FINTEGRAR" class="footer-brand-logo h-12 w-auto brightness-0 invert" />
          </a>
          <p class="text-[0.875rem] text-white/90 max-w-sm relative z-10 leading-relaxed lg:pr-4">
            36 años promoviendo el bienestar de nuestros asociados. Somos un Fondo de Empleados sin ánimo de lucro, legalmente constituido y vigilado por la Superintendencia de la Economía Solidaria.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 pt-4 lg:pt-10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-6 gap-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="footer-heading">Institución</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <li><a href="/quienes-somos" class="footer-link">Quiénes somos</a></li>
            <li><a href="/cuerpos-colegiados" class="footer-link">Junta Directiva</a></li>
            <li><a href="/cuerpos-colegiados" class="footer-link">Comité de Créditos</a></li>
            <li><a href="/documentacion" class="footer-link">Documentación</a></li>
            <li><a href="/sarlaft" class="footer-link">SARLAFT</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="footer-heading">Servicios</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <li><a href="/ahorros" class="footer-link">Modalidades de ahorro</a></li>
            <li><a href="/creditos" class="footer-link">Líneas de crédito</a></li>
            <li><a href="/rifa-semanal" class="footer-link">Rifa Semanal</a></li>
            <li><a href="/convenios" class="footer-link">Convenios</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pqrsf" class="footer-link">Radicar PQRSF</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="footer-heading">Accesos Directos</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <li>
              <a href="https://tramitesvirtuales.fintegrar.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                Trámites Virtuales
                <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.zonapagos.net/formulariosNV/?cod=BTK3a53qAPJK5dFzuUb9xoOMEi6GjxTVEz6jgj8WOG4kf7Z7mmbU2N6iG2sClbz5isF7xpuvz4ec%2FstAKWghYq2ihH6ea5Ab%2BfJXSgfBIPShwQxb9hHbzgY1XqGlsllif2sqgYeyszPfE%2Fq5SNonDhF9ZhqXm7OyDm%2Ba4lfdMItrvmOCQ5Py2gAq%2BvwFtoRMoNDPxeZKzglBDlEyqykoMK2kz6zyhc7dmjJO23oOZfDrWY5p5hfLu%2BH0xUIIx2%2F2zJLthSgc28WEY9rneC44s4DORf3zdoMntL1Bmxpscus%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                Pague en línea (PSE)
                <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              </a>
            </li>
            <li><a href="/directorio" class="footer-link">Directorio</a></li>
            <li><a href="/mapa-del-sitio" class="footer-link">Mapa del sitio</a></li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="footer-heading mt-6">Legales</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <li><a href="/politica-tratamiento-datos" class="footer-link">Política de Datos</a></li>
            <li><a href="/terminos-condiciones" class="footer-link">Términos y Condiciones</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ENTIDADES ALIADAS -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6 border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-6 flex flex-col items-center lg:items-end gap-4 mt-2">
        <h3 class="footer-heading footer-heading--plain whitespace-nowrap text-center lg:text-right">Entidades aliadas</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-end gap-x-8 gap-y-4">
          <img src="/assets/logos/aliados/prosalco.webp" alt="Prosalco" class="footer-ally-logo" />
          <div class="footer-ally-logo footer-ally-logo--placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Asociados Independientes">
            Asociados<br />Independientes
          </div>
          <img src="/assets/logos/aliados/policlinico-sur.webp" alt="Policlínico Sur" class="footer-ally-logo" />
          <img src="/assets/logos/aliados/sumemos-coop.webp" alt="Sumemos Coop" class="footer-ally-logo" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Dark Bottom Bar -->
  <div class="bg-[var(--color-brand-purple)] text-white/90 py-4 px-6 border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Vigilada -->
      <div class="footer-vigilada flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 flex-shrink-0" role="note" aria-label="Vigilada por la Superintendencia de la Economía Solidaria">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-stretch gap-[3px] w-fit flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="footer-vigilada-line !bg-white"></span>
          <span class="footer-vigilada-text text-center !text-white">VIGILADA</span>
          <span class="footer-vigilada-line !bg-white"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-vigilada-sub flex flex-col text-left leading-tight">
          <span class="text-white/90">SUPERINTENDENCIA DE LA</span>
          <span class="text-white/90">ECONOMÍA SOLIDARIA</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Copyright -->
      <div class="text-[0.75rem] text-center lg:text-left flex-1 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 md:gap-4 whitespace-nowrap">
        <span>© 2026 Fondo de Empleados - Fintegrar. Todos los derechos reservados.</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Socials -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0">
        <span class="text-[0.75rem] font-semibold text-white">Síguenos</span>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/p/Fintegrar-Fondo-de-Empleados-61579258882412/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-[var(--color-brand-purple)] transition-all text-white" aria-label="Facebook">
            <Icon name="tabler:brand-facebook" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/fintegrar_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-[var(--color-brand-purple)] transition-all text-white" aria-label="Instagram">
            <Icon name="tabler:brand-instagram" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=573174879669&text=Hola%2C+quisiera+informaci%C3%B3n+sobre+cr%C3%A9dito%2Fcartera.&type=phone_number&app_absent=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-[var(--color-brand-purple)] transition-all text-white" aria-label="WhatsApp">
            <Icon name="tabler:brand-whatsapp" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-light {
    background: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
  }

  .footer-brand-shape {
    top: -25%;
    bottom: -25%;
    right: -8%;
    height: 150%;
    width: auto;
    opacity: 0.08;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .footer-brand-shape {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .footer-divider {
    border-color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .footer-brand-logo {
    opacity: 1;
  }


  .footer-social-glass {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-social-glass:hover {
    background: var(--color-brand-purple, #722cce);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .footer-heading {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    padding-bottom: 0.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .footer-heading--plain {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
    padding-bottom: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .footer-link {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
    color: #4b5563;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .footer-link:not(.inline-flex) {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .footer-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand-purple, #722cce);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .footer-link--static {
    color: #4b5563;
    transform: none !important; /* Don't move the static text on hover */
  }

  .footer-ally-logo {
    height: 32px;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 140px;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0.85;
    filter: invert(1);
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .footer-ally-logo:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-ally-logo--placeholder {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--ff-sans);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold);
    line-height: var(--lh-115);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    filter: none;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-ally-logo--placeholder:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-vigilada-line {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .footer-vigilada-text {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold);
    color: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .footer-vigilada-sub {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .footer-fineprint {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
</style>
